.TH FATHOM_ATTRIBUTION_FORGET 1  "fathom 0.1.0-alpha.1" 
.SH NAME
fathom\-attribution\-forget \- Forget one stored correction
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfathom attribution forget\fR [\fB\-\-root\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIIDENTITY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Forget one stored correction
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<ROOT>\fR [default: .]
The repository to write to
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the result as JSON on stdout, and nothing else there
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIIDENTITY\fR>
The identity key to forget, as `fathom attribution list` prints it
